.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvqJFR-5osbiwTDIorwTsKh38bVEdSxbOztuSPxgOc1GQ&oe=69A98D2D"}, "display_name": "VAIL", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "multiplayer", "social", "extraction"], "long_description": "Jump into VAIL, the #1 VR shooter playground!\nHang out in the social hub, customize your gear, and dive into 10+ game modes like Team Deathmatch, Seek and Destroy, Free for All, and more.\nDiscover a FREE-TO-PLAY massive Extraction island and squad up with friends!              \n\n{1419076756672610}\n\n#  **EXTRACTION (FREE EARLY ACCESS)**\nDescend into the depths of Reyn to extract encrypted data, technology, and resources while autonomous drones guard it like archangels.\n\n{4183579475189240}\n\n\n\n#  **TRAINING GROUNDS (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nEngage in non-stop action on four free-to-play maps designed to improve skill with weapon pickups and loadout modifiers.\n\n{826869113772460}\n{1861007317926953}\n\n\n#  **SOCIAL HUB (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nChallenge others to intense 1v1 battles, get the best score in mini-golf, and unlock VAIL Combat or other rewards by extracting ORE shards from the quarry.\n\n{911511758042190}\n{1547957886294186}\n\n\n#  **VAIL COMBAT (DLC)**\nGain full access to VAIL's complete experience. Dominate in popular team-based and free-for-all game modes as you level up, unlock rewards, and top the leaderboards.\n\n{1220581586247000}\n\n\n\n# **CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED**\n\n{988770307650678}\n\nJoin the party!\nDiscord.gg/VAILVR\n\n{875677118774648}", "short_description": "Jump into VAIL, the #1 VR shooter playground.\nHang out in the social hub, customize your gear, and dive into 10+ game modes like Team Deathmatch, Seek and Destroy, Free for All, and many many more. \nDiscover a FREE-TO-PLAY massive Extraction island and squad up with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aexlab.com/aexlab/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AEXLAB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": 